# Normalise to LF everywhere, including in Windows working trees.
#
# The fixtures are committed AND regenerated by scripts/make_fixtures.py, which
# writes LF. Without this, a Windows checkout produces CRLF and the "fixtures
# are reproducible from the generator" check in CI (and `git diff`) reports a
# spurious change on every line.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.psv        text eol=lf
*.sh         text eol=lf
Makefile     text eol=lf

*.parquet    binary
*.png        binary
*.pdf        binary
